OL,3,GNEWSABusiness 'shocked' at double
OL,4,Adragon investment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA business owner has said he was
OL,7,F"completely shocked" after being
OL,8,Foffered more money than he was asking
OL,9,Ffor on the BBC's Dragons' Den.
OL,11,FSam Mabley, from Bristol, founded the
OL,12,Fsustainable fashion company Yes Friends
OL,13,Fin 2021 and was approaching the dragons
OL,14,Fto ask for #10,000 in exchange for a 2%
OL,15,Fshare of the business.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
