OL,3,GNEWSABusiness 'shocked' at double
OL,4,Adragon investment
OL,5,
OL,6,FYes Friends, which says it seeks to
OL,7,F"transform the fashion industry" by
OL,8,Fcreating affordable, ethical and
OL,9,Fsustainable clothing, caught the eye of
OL,10,FDeborah Meaden, who offered Mabley
OL,11,Fdouble what he was asking for in
OL,12,Fexchange for the same share.
OL,14,F"I was completely shocked, I didn't
OL,15,Fknow what to say," said Mabley.
